    "probe": "kicad-cli",
    "note": "KiCad 9's headless CLI — ERC, DRC, netlist/BOM/SVG/Gerber/drill/pos/STEP exports (pcb-0) — from the prf-pcb-engines image (polari-rf-node/prf-pcb-engines, Debian trixie pinned by digest + kicad=9.0.2+dfsg-1 + kicad-symbols + kicad-footprints, NOT kicad-packages3d) or a local KiCad install (pcb-na's native app)"
   }
  ],
  "engines_note": "resolved through pcb.custom.pcb_engines (PCB_ENGINES_URL → local kicad-cli → the local image PCB_ENGINES_IMAGE (prf-pcb-engines:trixie, polari-rf-node/prf-pcb-engines) → topology provider pcb.engines (PROVIDER_PORTS prf-pcb-engines:9860) → refusal naming the knob + image); a declared worker never silently falls back to local"
 },
